title: "esn-vla-uq: Uncertainty quantification for VLA policies via Echo State Networks"
abstract: >-
  Closed-form, ensemble-free uncertainty quantification for vision-language-action
  policies using Echo State Networks, with built-in reservoir diagnostics
  (spectral radius, echo state property, memory capacity).
